VALIDATION BOUNDARY

On 2026-10-21 the maintainer confirmed the new running crDroid 17.0 ROM on the
OnePlus 13. Settings showed maximum capacity 5472 mAh and battery health 92%,
matching the expected compensated reporting. Functional ROM/UI acceptance is
complete on that basis. This is a direct maintainer report, not an independent
physical capacity measurement or validation of every device/configuration.

Strict source application and reversal, 20 C host cases with ASan/UBSan and a
negative control, and compilation of the complete changed driver translation
unit with Android clang r596125 / 22.0.2 were verified. Gauge APIs in the host
check are fixtures. Those checks are distinct from the maintainer-reported
installed ROM/UI result above. Source reversal is not an installed-device rollback.
